# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Playwright MCP scratch output (screenshots, console/page dumps)
.playwright-mcp/

# Wrangler's local dev state, written by `just docs-preview`.
.wrangler/

# Documentation site build output. `scripts/build-docs.mjs` renders docs/
# into these paths so Cloudflare Pages serves them at /docs. It is ~800
# generated files; the source of truth is docs/. Build before deploying —
# `just deploy-landing` does that for you.
landing/docs.html
landing/docs/

# CocoaPods / Carthage (if ever used)
Pods/
Carthage/Build/

# Fastlane
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output

# Curfew release artifacts
release/
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.zip

# License signing keys — NEVER commit. Generated by scripts/gen-license-keypair.sh.
# The private key is loaded into the Worker as a secret, not stored in the repo.
license_private.key
license_public.key
*.key
